These weights are a modified version of the FLUX Model, prepared by
Kelsey1217 for NPU inference. Modifications include BFP16 conversion of the
transformer and text encoder matrices, NPU memory layouts, transposition and
padding where required, and packing the converted files into U8 safetensors
shards. This package is not an official Black Forest Labs product and has not
been endorsed, approved or validated by Black Forest Labs Inc.

