The text encoder (text/) is converted from Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct, shipped in
the upstream repository's text_encoder/ folder under the Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE-Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct). Copyright Alibaba Cloud / Qwen team. Only its
language-model layers are included, converted to BFP16 NPU layouts.

The VAE decoder and encoder folders are the upstream autoencoder
(ae.safetensors) in NPU layouts; its weights are the same as the FLUX.2 Klein
autoencoder's.
